      "narrative_4lang": {
        "de": "Entdecken Sie den modernen Charme von Chelmer Village kombiniert mit historischer Wassertechnik. Vom belebten Square führt Sie der Weg durch grüne Parks zum idyllischen Bunny Walk am Flussufer. Der Höhepunkt ist die Sandford Mill, wo die Industriegeschichte von Essex lebendig wird.",
        "hu": "Fedezze fel Chelmer Village modern báját a történelmi vízitechnikával ötvözve. A nyüzsgő térről zöld parkokon át vezet az út az idilli Bunny Walk folyóparti sétányhoz. A nap csúcspontja a Sandford Mill, ahol Essex ipari múltja elevenedik meg.",
        "ro": "Descoperiți farmecul modern din Chelmer Village combinat cu tehnologia hidraulică istorică. De la piața animată, drumul vă poartă prin parcuri verzi spre faleza idilică Bunny Walk. Punctul culminant este Sandford Mill, unde istoria industrială din Essex prinde viață.",
        "en": "Discover the modern charm of Chelmer Village combined with historic water engineering. From the bustling Square, the path leads through green parks to the idyllic Bunny Walk riverside stroll. The highlight is Sandford Mill, where Essex's industrial history comes to life."
      },
